  "body": "### Summary\nLOT-056 (#82, PR #261) needs this state captured, to verify the image-host adapter table instead of relying on what the legacy code does.\n\nState: one of the http-only image hosts seen in R20/R21/R22a, requested over https, logged out and without cookies: does it answer, upgrade or fail? This settles LOT-056's observedHTTPOnly list and LOT-083's App Transport Security choice.\n\nAcceptance criteria\n- Captured request and answer, anonymized, with a MANIFEST row.\n- docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md §6c, LOT-056 subsection: the row is moved from 'code' to 'verified'.",
