   "body": "**Capture result** (PR #435, 2026-11-02): `T10`-`T15`, `T11h`, `T14h` (one R20/R22a image per host, https, cookie-less). `si1.photorapide.com` serves https (200 image/jpeg); `www.camif.fr` serves https (404 for the old file) and redirects http → https; `yelims.free.fr` refuses TCP 443 and serves http (200 image/gif): the only http-only host observed; `nsa34.casimages.com`, `img15.hostingpics.net`, `bibi.hn.org` have no DNS answer. LOT-056's `observedHTTPOnly` list is now verified only for free.fr; HFR-PROTOCOL §6c LOT-056 moved the row to verified. Follow-up for the table: see the follow-up issue linked below.",
